<title>ITALY: Milan airport ground staff to strike November six.</title>
<headline>Milan airport ground staff to strike November six.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ground staff at northern Italian airports Linate and Malpensa, which both serve Milan, have declared a 24-hour strike on Wednesday November 6, the airport management company SEA Aeroporti di Milano said.</p>
<p>SEA said in a statement that traffic would be normal between 07.00 and 10.00 local time (06.00 and 09.00 GMT) and between 18.00 and 21.00 local (17.00 and 20.00 GMT).</p>
<p>The strike is linked to renewal of labour contracts.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
